/**
 * Client-side verdictToken verification.
 *
 * A verdictToken is an ES256 JWT decision receipt minted by the edge and bound
 * to session (`sub`), origin (`aud`), and `jti` with a short `exp`. This module
 * validates shape, signature (against the JWKS served from
 * GET /.well-known/jwks.json), expiry, session binding, and, when an expected
 * audience is supplied, origin binding. Rejection reasons are surfaced as
 * `VerdictTokenError.code`.
